  "description": "MORE TRAVEL. MORE PLEASURE. The SCARP EVO II frame took KTM all the way to the World Cup podium. Now it's your turn to write your own SCARP success story. Never underestimate the impact of more travel on a race bike. Launched in 2020 the Scarp MT expanded the KTM MTB range. MT, short for marathon, combines the advantages of more travel with an ultra-light race frame. KTMs STRAIGHT-LINE-LINK (SLL) technology matched with 115 mm rear and 120 mm front travel, which guarantees optimum performance over long distances even on rough terrain. A trail orientated specification ensures the pleasure of an extra-long marathon adventure. A 67.5 head angle, enough space for a second bottle cage, as well as a dropper seat post at some of the models, wraps up the MT concept. Available at five different price points and specification versions. With a weight of less than 10 kg, the top model SCARP MT EXONIC is absolutely suitable for cross country races. Like their big brother, PRIME and MASTER rely on a full carbon frame, while the entry-level models ELITE and PRO are equipped with an aluminium rear triangle.",
